    "show_share": true,
    "description": "This video presents Professor \n    Jonas Otterbeck 's research on popular culture and Islam. It argues for the need to understand and engage with Islamic-themed popular culture as so many Muslims do. The video features discussions with Professor Otterbeck and the photographer Peter Sanders, as well as music and videos from Poetic Pilgrimage, Mona Haydar, Maher Zain, Harris J and artwork and films from Marvel HQ, Al Jazzera, ID Mobile.",
